{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VendorIdentifierKey","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The system gives the same identifier to every app of one vendor on one device, and a new one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"once all of them are removed. Traffluent reads it and never stores it, nor makes one up where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the system has none: on macOS and Linux, and on a device whose system hasn’t one yet (just"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"restarted, still locked), records carry no key. It is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"type":"text","text":" value, so a destination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reads it only through the record it arrived in, and not at all once a delivery redacts it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let vendorID = record.context[VendorIdentifierKey.self].flatMap(record.reveal)  \/\/ a UUID"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Type Aliases","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/VendorIdentifierKey\/Value"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/VendorIdentifierKey\/InstrumentationContextKey-Implementations"]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/standardcontext\/vendoridentifierkey"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration